        rdfs:comment                   "Christening mantle and robe of silk trimmed with lace, England, 1700-1729."@en , "Christening mantle and robe of silver tissue with a palmette and floral design and lined with cream silk. The mantle is edged with gold lace and the robe with gold braid. The robe opens at the back to below the waist, with a full gathered skirt and short sleeves."@en ;
